---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Hello · Niyora"
  description="Talk to Neha, the founder of Niyora. Tell her what helped, what felt unclear, and what to build next. Her inbox is open and she reads it herself."
  ogImage="https://assets.niyora.com/niyora-launch-poster.jpg"
  canonicalUrl="https://niyora.com/talk/"
>
  <section class="s hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Talk to me</div>
    <h1>Hello!</h1>
    <p class="lead">I’m Neha, the founder of Niyora.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="s">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        If you’ve tried Niyora and something felt helpful, unclear, or worth
        improving, I’d love to hear from you. Your feedback helps shape Niyora
        into something calmer, simpler, and more useful.
      </p>
      <p>
        For ideas, thoughts, or anything else, my inbox is open. You can also
        say hi on LinkedIn, I’d be happy to chat.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="email"><a href="mailto:neha@niyora.com?subject=Niyora">neha@niyora.com</a></p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-neha-prasad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find me on LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  /* Page-specific only: the reading column and the mailto line. Shared chrome
     (sheet, sections, dividers, type scale, buttons, footer) comes from Page. */
  .prose { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .prose p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .email { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 400; user-select: all; }
  .email a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.4);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .email a:hover { border-color: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.9); }

  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 28px; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .s { padding: 56px 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    .prose p { font-size: 16px; }
  }
</style>
